'''Gifts '''is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 6th tier in the Main Event during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through [[Trading]] as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is dark purple with four gifts varying in colors and sizes on it, hence the name. The guard is also dark purple, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Gifts (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

